  "m2_criterion": {
    "id": "M2_source_attested",
    "definition": "Current source-attested five-character Malaysia postcode-to-city/state dictionary with leading zeroes, exact edition, retrieval time, SHA-256, field-level rights, reproducible normalization and exception lineage. MCMC data.gov.my can provide a dated rights-cleared dictionary, not direct live Pos Malaysia validity: preserve annual update caveats, missing row effective dates, whitespace duplicates and postcode-to-multiple-city ambiguity. Require an approved immutable data artifact and downloaded-hash verification through the actual MY AGID loader/API. Retain geometry none without a separately permitted explicit postal-authority boundary; any administrative join or model surface is derived and uncertainty-bearing. MyGDX training/catalog pages, UPU examples, MyGeo inventories, UPI parcels and place names cannot create assignments or exact civic/building relations. House numbers and buildings require independent rights-cleared explicit relations. Scope, time, identity, topology if applicable, privacy and actual coverage must be validated. Synthetic tests and a local observation experiment never establish M2."
